    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How many",
     "texto": [
      "**Quanto** agrees with the noun: **quanti libri?** (masculine plural), **quante stanze?** (feminine plural).",
      "Some very common adjectives usually go before the noun: **nuovo**, **bello**, **piccolo**, **grande**. But colours always go after it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
